  "note": "Conservative mapping of free-text evidence labels to five classes, reviewed 2026-11-17. When a label mixes kinds, the weaker class wins (estimate or analysis over reported or observed). The owner may revise any row; validate:tactics fails on a referenced label that is missing here.",
